From 9af07b972da022ed3920d7efa4df9134375499e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:23:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] oem: arm: run internal crashlog transfer on event thread

FileDescriptor and the PLDM requester belong to pldmd's event thread.
Starting a transfer from the detached crashlog worker races with
endpoint discovery, request timers, and transfer state.

Dispatch descriptor discovery, file-size reads, and transfer startup
through an eventfd watched by the event loop. Keep socket draining and
archive creation on the worker. Hold each descriptor until the stream
is drained and release it on its owning thread. Contain exceptions in
the detached worker.

Continue using the internal transfer API without a D-Bus File.Open call.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/pldm/+/96500]

Change-Id: Id5d7a0b33407f60ad75479b50968cc2099352315
Signed-off-by: Manoj Kumar Prabakaran <manojkumar.prabakaran@arm.com>
---
